### Feature Customers — GET ALL / GET ONE (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
# access_token: npm run dev:token -- admin  (o POST /api/sesion/login desde ISS-15)
@token = pega-aqui-el-access-token

### GET ALL (solo activos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET ONE
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET ONE con id inválido → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
